Herdr fork modifications

This repository contains Rolf's fork of Herdr, the terminal multiplexer
maintained by the Herdr contributors at https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr.
Upstream Herdr is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Modifications by Rolf, 2026, include parent and child agent lineage in the
CLI and API, local and cross-machine sidebar trees, persistence of lineage,
server restart and agent resume changes, additional agent detection, and
fork documentation. AI coding agents assisted with implementation under
Rolf's direction.

The upstream LICENSE and third-party license files are retained. This notice
identifies fork modifications and does not imply upstream endorsement.
